#: dc1706e9caf54273b5ea2008a1b6dda4 f8f101c521304d19bd1b68b4585f98d1
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr "DShot 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:76
#: 1701ab0d15b54203b9b82f099dc83185 1814be7b8d55467aac2fa4e6823b83db
#: 2295613391e146b1a097e379bead742c 30ced588917d43a0abd03930ae9f3991
#: 8ffb226355c547479026a96df147efdb ea46a35f534c4974a87570371fd2b500
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and"
" normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling "
"Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be "
"configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups "
"that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal "
"servo/motor output) are: 1/2, 3/4, 5/6, 7/8/9 , and 10."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。但在同一组内混用 DShot 和普通 PWM 受到限制，即在某组内为某输出启用 "
"DShot，则该组所有输出均须配置并使用 DShot，而非 PWM 输出。必须使用相同模式（PWM 频率或 "
"DShot，配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）的输出组为：1/2、3/4、5/6、7/8/9 以及 10。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:78
